    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Kelly Estates are delighted to bring to the market this charming three-bedroom semi-detached cottage, providing countryside lifestyle while remaining within easy reach of the popular and well established area of Newcastle. 10 Ballynakelly Cottages comes to the market vacant and ready to move into.\n\nThe mature gardens are a beautiful feature of the property, boasting a large number of established trees and fruit trees. The property also benefits from a large rear garden, front garden with space for ample parking and side access to the rear garden.\n\nTucked away within a quiet cul-de-sac, No. 10 enjoys a wonderful sense of privacy and tranquillity. One of the property's most impressive features is its beautiful, West-facing rear garden. Mature and exceptionally private, this 50ft long garden enjoys excellent natural light throughout the day and provides a wonderful setting for outdoor dining, entertaining, and family life. Its generous proportions also offer considerable potential for a purchaser wishing to further enhance the property, subject to any necessary planning permission. \n\nNumber 10 is an attractive home that comprises of a entrance hall, living room, kitchen / dining area, 3 bedroom and 2 bathroom. This property sits on approximately c.0.12 acres which is extremely private and quiet.\n\nBright and spacious throughout this property offers a comfortable layout with the potential for the new owner to put their own stamp on the property and create a comfortable and welcoming home. \n\nIdeally situated, No.10 is within walking distance to all local amenities, including shops, schools, childcare facilities and parks. There is easy access to the City Centre with an excellent bus network on the doorstep and also the N7, M50 & N4 motorways are close by. \n\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the potential of this property. \n\n400 m to 68 & 6W Bus ( Luas link bus)\n500 m to Newcastle Spar\n700 m to Newcastle Supervalu\n900 m to Graydon Park\n1300 m to Newcastle Lidl\n1200 m to St Finians School\n4.2 km to Hazelhatch Train Station\n6.1 km to Celbridge Village\n8.3 km to Lucan\n12 km to Maynooth University via the 6w Bus\n16 km to Grafton Street Dublin\n22 km to Dublin Airport\nAll distances are approximate.\n\nEarly interest is expected, be sure to contact Kelly Estates today for further information or to arrange viewing! All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.\n\nPlease note: Visit Kelly Estates on Facebook, Instagram or Tiktok for videos of the property. Early interest is expected, be sure to contact Kelly Estates today for further information or to arrange viewing! All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.\n "
      },
